{
  "__inputs": [
    {
      "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
      "label": "Prometheus",
      "description": "The Prometheus that scrapes loomwatch.",
      "type": "datasource",
      "pluginId": "prometheus",
      "pluginName": "Prometheus"
    }
  ],
  "__requires": [
    {
      "type": "grafana",
      "id": "grafana",
      "name": "Grafana",
      "version": "10.0.0"
    },
    {
      "type": "datasource",
      "id": "prometheus",
      "name": "Prometheus",
      "version": "1.0.0"
    },
    {
      "type": "panel",
      "id": "stat",
      "name": "Stat",
      "version": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "panel",
      "id": "timeseries",
      "name": "Time series",
      "version": ""
    }
  ],
  "id": null,
  "title": "loomwatch - LLM quotas",
  "description": "Remaining LLM subscription quota per provider, quota window and account. Utilisation is a share of the plan's own limit, so 100 is the quota itself.",
  "tags": [
    "loomwatch",
    "llm",
    "quota"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "provider",
        "label": "Provider",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
        },
        "query": "label_values(loomwatch_quota_utilization_percent, provider)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "quota_type",
        "label": "Quota window",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
        },
        "query": "label_values(loomwatch_quota_utilization_percent{provider=~\"$provider\"}, quota_type)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "team",
        "type": "query",
        "label": "Team",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
        },
        "query": "label_values(loomwatch:account_team, team)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        },
        "sort": 1,
        "description": "Empty until metrics.prometheusRule.teams is configured in the chart: team ownership is a recording rule, not a label the collector exports."
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Quota utilisation",
      "description": "Share of each plan's own limit. The account is part of the series identity on purpose: collapsing it would show that a quota is running out without saying whose.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "max by (provider, quota_type, account_id) (loomwatch_quota_utilization_percent{provider=~\"$provider\",quota_type=~\"$quota_type\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{provider}} / {{quota_type}} / acct {{account_id}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 80
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 95
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Time until reset",
      "description": "How long the current window still has to run. A series is absent when the provider schedules no reset.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "max by (provider, quota_type, account_id) (loomwatch_quota_reset_timestamp_seconds{provider=~\"$provider\",quota_type=~\"$quota_type\"} - time())",
          "legendFormat": "{{provider}} / {{quota_type}} / acct {{account_id}}",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Projected at reset",
      "description": "Current utilisation plus the 24h trend extrapolated to this series' own reset time. Above 100 the window runs out before it resets. Long horizons make this noisy - treat a far-off reset as a weak signal.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 9
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "max by (provider, quota_type, account_id) (loomwatch_quota_utilization_percent{provider=~\"$provider\",quota_type=~\"$quota_type\"}) + max by (provider, quota_type, account_id) (deriv(loomwatch_quota_utilization_percent{provider=~\"$provider\",quota_type=~\"$quota_type\"}[24h])) * max by (provider, quota_type, account_id) (loomwatch_quota_reset_timestamp_seconds{provider=~\"$provider\",quota_type=~\"$quota_type\"} - time())",
          "legendFormat": "{{provider}} / {{quota_type}} / acct {{account_id}}",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 80
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 100
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Collector health",
      "description": "1 when the collector has recent successful data for the provider. This reflects poll freshness, not credential validity.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 9
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "min by (provider) (loomwatch_agent_healthy{provider=~\"$provider\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{provider}}",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "stale",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "fresh",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Age of last successful poll",
      "description": "Companion to collector health: catches the collector stalling while its own health flag still reads healthy.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 15
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "max by (provider, account_id) (loomwatch_agent_last_cycle_age_seconds{provider=~\"$provider\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{provider}} / acct {{account_id}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Quota utilisation by team",
      "description": "Same measurement as the first panel, attributed to the team that owns each account. Empty until metrics.prometheusRule.teams is configured - ownership is published by the chart as loomwatch:account_team, not exported by the collector. Accounts with no entry appear as team \"unassigned\" rather than disappearing. Aggregated with max, never sum: utilisation is a percentage of each plan's own limit, so two accounts at 50% are not 100% of anything.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 22
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "max by (team, provider, quota_type, account_id) (loomwatch_quota_utilization_percent{provider=~\"$provider\",quota_type=~\"$quota_type\"} * on (provider, account_id) group_left(team) loomwatch:account_team{team=~\"$team\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{team}} / {{provider}} / acct {{account_id}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 80
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 95
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
